t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsijJpwYTqjVlqkqX-n02aW5F7Cb7ab5e3FGMIlRdIjCw&oe=6999BDB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZoYwX87xQGAQ7kNvwEp_Ff3&_nc_oc=AdmFg6No-UOxwVJBwNtwmJmVgl4E8wO1J5dvgTf_NnbKO6MhAIc95yWXhdHRCVJoLdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5TeSHRBThJDAZj1FONAYeQfxwpIS0mL6NULE-rns4xg&oe=6999BF4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nz6XfDkiH94Q7kNvwFbrkMU&_nc_oc=AdnS6ltxnS5DGsC-AmeYVoiindIIDhGI3ObveejsSaatCELPd9-SN2mcv9t1MHipJI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuq65pxFeRUUhWDddetcmrs5mLt-XcLaniYzhscc0cWkg&oe=6999AC6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jfTuJh4Oy_sQ7kNvwFeCibT&_nc_oc=AdnRZLcFBX2gIFQLkwvze4n00XzKz1dAbKSYUw_5K7NynEBWfYGR4yGp_6tnD9vDjWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsi5s-MkgsdiLVh1U5iWLjHA_BAxgC7RkN3BrbeS4wmSQ&oe=699995C3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TspqFVttpGkQ7kNvwFDh-PU&_nc_oc=AdkNNS5tJQ-PSibzRDfbOE0c3TFJwh6JwcUh6QjTDDuftSVk7ztBpalG01JAJ7BoKCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuHjL7Hhe9SiH6XzsT7noab1iCC4YctIIE7TTLIHT6FFA&oe=69998E18"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iD36bjHMJJ0Q7kNvwE6SjB9&_nc_oc=AdmAUKMxXWpymEO_pyfO-KWg0ChhlNQeaa4ZYynlC9rEgJ7VFWq39wefHQKBZvbDPdU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuVKMUCTk67dg8_90BPZe13Q-GLT6_T0J-dlaWMck9uYQ&oe=6999A13C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=chqsFzZJL8oQ7kNvwHUJUbw&_nc_oc=AdlRVDZse1KM7KcbHV65NqCsBLeFFHlwYFv-klmwSvO0123enw2UK2zpalhFgZMvUJo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=sco