t=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsijJpwYTqjVlqkqX-n02aW5F7Cb7ab5e3FGMIlRdIjCw&oe=6999BDB7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZoYwX87xQGAQ7kNvwEp_Ff3&_nc_oc=AdmFg6No-UOxwVJBwNtwmJmVgl4E8wO1J5dvgTf_NnbKO6MhAIc95yWXhdHRCVJoLdc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft5TeSHRBThJDAZj1FONAYeQfxwpIS0mL6NULE-rns4xg&oe=6999BF4A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nz6XfDkiH94Q7kNvwFbrkMU&_nc_oc=AdnS6ltxnS5DGsC-AmeYVoiindIIDhGI3ObveejsSaatCELPd9-SN2mcv9t1MHipJI0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afuq65pxFeRUUhWDddetcmrs5mLt-XcLaniYzhscc0cWkg&oe=6999AC6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running